0,south,"I will start by moving away from the vertical wall and explore the horizontal closed door that is far eastnortheast. Once I find a way to open it, I will explore the new room. The goal is to find the stairs down. I will search for hidden doors and passages regularly to ensure I don't miss any potential paths. My plan is to move around the room, searching for hidden doors and trying to open any closed doors I find. Once I have explored a room thoroughly, I will move to a new area and repeat the process. I will use my kick action if I encounter a locked door, but I will try to search for hidden doors first to avoid wasting a kick attempt. If I find a new room, I will move in a general north-south direction to keep the eastern wall as my boundary.","message:


